      "description": "Watch Rennes vs Paris Saint Germain highlights and goals from Ligue 1 on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 23, 2026. The lights of the Roazhon Park shone bright on August 23, 2026, as Rennes and Paris Saint Germain locked horns in a pivotal Ligue 1 fixture. Fans expected a tactical masterclass, but what they witnessed was a raw display of momentum shifts and individual brilliance. Rennes Stun the Champions Early The match ignited within the first ten minutes as the home side took a shock lead. In the 9th minute, Sebastian Szymanski unleashed a thunderous left-footed strike from outside the box that flew into the top left corner, leaving the PSG defense static. The visitors tried to claw their way back, with Ousmane Dembélé and João Neves testing the resolve of the Rennes backline, but the hosts remained clinical on the break. That clinical edge was on full display again in the 38th minute. A pinpoint cross from Przemyslaw Frankowski found Estéban Lepaul in the center of the box, and the forward made no mistake, guiding his shot into the bottom right corner. Paris Saint Germain headed into the halftime interval trailing by two goals, frustrated by missed opportunities and the goalkeeping of Brice Samba . Ferran Torres Inspires the Comeback The second half saw a completely different PSG side, bolstered by the introductions of Ferran Torres and Mika Godts . The pressure finally told in the 71st minute when Fabián Ruiz threaded a pass to Ferran Torres , who finished calmly into the bottom corner. A VAR review briefly held up the celebrations, but the goal stood, and the momentum shifted entirely in favor of the Parisians. With ten minutes remaining, the comeback was completed. In the 82nd minute, Fabián Ruiz turned provider once more, whipping in a cross that Ferran Torres met with a powerful header to find the bottom right corner. The final stages were frantic; Ludovic Blas nearly snatched a winner for Rennes , while Mika Godts missed a late chance for the visitors. Ultimately, both sides shared the spoils in a breathless encounter on 2026-08-23."
